---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import nolanPhoto from "../assets/nolan.jpg";
---

<Layout
  title="Meet Nolan | Sounds So Far"
  description="Nolan Haines, from Santa Cruz, California: the story behind Sounds So Far."
>
<main>
<section class="alt">
  <div class="wrap founder">
    <figure>
      <Image src={nolanPhoto} alt="Nolan Haines standing in a mountain meadow" width={900} />
    </figure>
    <div>
    <h2>Meet Nolan</h2>
    <p class="lead">I&rsquo;m Nolan Haines, from Santa Cruz, California. Music has been in my life as long as I can remember. I sang in jazz choir and concert choir, and my grandparents are jazz musicians.</p>
    <p class="lead">The idea came on a slow night working at a bar in Austin, Texas. A coworker and I were workshopping ideas, and one thing led to another: what if the studio came to up-and-coming artists, instead of them coming to us?</p>
    <p class="lead">So Sounds So Far is a racecar trailer rebuilt as a studio, with living quarters attached. A garage door on the side slides up and becomes a little stage, so friends and neighbors can gather outside to watch. Each artist tells their back story, plays their best songs, and shows off the town they&rsquo;re from &mdash; because every artist deserves a stage, wherever they are.</p>
    <blockquote class="quote">&ldquo;The world is craving authenticity and genuine creativity in the age of digital and AI. I&rsquo;m going to bring a grounded, down-to-earth concept to fruition in order to quench that thirst for life we all crave.&rdquo;<cite>Nolan Haines</cite></blockquote>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
</main>
</Layout>
